  <item>
    <title>备婚的艺术05 | 踏上独立婚礼策划师之路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63b3f5ff289d2739647d9382</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63b3f5ff289d2739647d9382</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 03 Jan 2023 09:31:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期笔记 Key takeaway</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>*婚庆公司v.s.独立婚礼策划师</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>商业感 v.s. 人情味</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>模式化 v.s. 定制化</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>没有自我价值 v.s. 充满创造力和幸福感</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>*怎么定义独立婚礼策划师？——“我的答案是审美的独立、价值观的独立、策划理念的独立。”</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>审美的独立：不是人云亦云的审美，也不是抄袭的审美</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>价值观的独立：不仅仅停留在设计的层面去探讨婚礼，而是要从内在的情感层面去带领新人思考这场婚礼对于他们的意义</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>理念的独立：“回归婚礼本质 ，爱与分享”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lp1yJCr5z3FpewuLK3IAySrlia4_.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsF4M3qfERH9G6PbSkqPxcX0k8Wk.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fin4un92s6ui6clYxY1N1Xq8faZo.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuFL-r1WCffVPlNtFtSlBmtUtzLf.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj2tRQby6In8YyL79ntJ1pE5-Bxj.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmWLDJKdn3FShq3hmgvU9v2zwydU.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsGQWT3-OLzCyPQCZcyEDJ-eIPP2.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqR0lX3Ox6L98n0utXyaucY9TtnO.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luuNYpWAW09keJBMd0SIvMozngLy.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
