  <item>
    <title>备婚的艺术04 | 新中式婚礼≠红色</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63b2855e9acee6cd2f84e3d8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63b2855e9acee6cd2f84e3d8</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Jan 2023 07:18:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期笔记 Key takeaway</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>*我们所理解的新中式是从传统的文化中去提取一些恰当的意象和元素，用一种更加当代的设计手法去展现传统的韵味和意境。&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>从颜色出发，新中式也可以做的很清雅：选择配色的时候可以结合当下的时令感和新人的气质</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>强调主题的立意，从设计和流程上创造一个整体的氛围：从地缘文化出发，结合当地的传统习俗，更能体现新中式婚礼的特色</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>说到新中式元素，我们提倡用恰到好处的材质，结合环境的特点去体现新中式的意境：比如用纱去结合光影，或是用多变的手法去运用竹子</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqVjcarQOwCTIhsbCJ7ph0QMsYxn.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnni8wzYjyNo118zLKPqhLoM1Amk.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiHzrGl1HIGdsIh-FnfONm0fEbM3.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnBTeCrAWPQ8Eyyn9ArgAyY7x3t0.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhUMkr3mWsnmXWgpZg-F9Sd_GkJZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkusrIVixgh-zqoEEnyAAgQ18ohL.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmfx0-RJyTQWvjwbYHLaUIemyz9S.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlI68NUPTg8nWm9mtidtT5Z-PxJ0.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lt_LkNy25d9j35mz3Y144TkD_D01.m4a" length="13543212" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:07:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZoNnlqMy1RY0RhUy1XcGp0X3daMGhOa1UyYmMucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
