    <guid isPermaLink="false">63a13bdd4ded9d81d0a11797</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Dec 2022 04:36:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期笔记 Key takeaway</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>*请柬是宾客对婚礼的第一印象，它决定了大家对你的婚礼有一种什么样的期待。</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么我们一直坚持在做纸质请柬？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>实物的设计和质感：可以结合新人故事、婚礼主题或特殊材质</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>仪式感和人情味：在收送请柬的过程中完成一种情感的传递</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>纪念意义：每每看到都会让人回忆起这场婚礼</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv4dyl0reRJ9Kr7Fumon1jqFpJqI.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liYIM0ACJ8FEUASaLB9YFKIFVjY1.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgQo5BvDbLyZWVm_FGVK6Qtq5cqh.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm_OYK6nBOB0GCL6hwG9Muf0ppcm.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlZsxCw7Ckclm85Nlz89PbmI4EKr.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FogcQzivYy64_U9Eq-krswZmBgDv.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrGBI0MOMafeuj3a939j8H-WntzC.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuz5Bx8FWsgmo8DTiY1AFhuMjpYE.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlkrdS2c2rncqyjtztmLROBBAScu.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lu4DPeS0DYr5f56awyo-D0fimURY.m4a" length="11270857" type="audio/mp4"/>
